 783:Core/Src/main.c **** /**
 784:Core/Src/main.c ****  * Command replies still transmit in blocking mode -- they are rare and
 785:Core/Src/main.c ****  * user-triggered. HAL refuses a transmit while gState is BUSY_TX, so wait out
 786:Core/Src/main.c ****  * any stream frame first rather than letting the reply be dropped. Bounded by
 787:Core/Src/main.c ****  * one frame time, ~360us at 2,097,000 baud.
 788:Core/Src/main.c ****  */
